## Context

`tests/test_ready.sh` has two weak JSON assertions:

1. Line 192: `grep -q '"id"'` passes on any JSON containing the string `id`.
   At that point the only ready ticket is `0002-blocked.erg`, so the correct
   assertion is `'"id": "0002"'`.

2. Line 233: `grep -q '"tags": \['` is slightly fragile — tighten to
   `'"tags": \[\]'` since the ticket (`0041-untagged.erg`) has no Tags header
   and the JSON output should be `"tags": []`.

## Actions

1. Line 192: Change `grep -q '"id"'` to `grep -q '"id": "0002"'`
2. Line 233: Change `grep -q '"tags": \['` to `grep -q '"tags": \[\]'`

## Exit criteria

- `make test-ready` passes (21/21)
- Both assertions are tightened to specific expected values
